Z||000032||Bugsy||07-11-2000||10:48 AM||||I'm confused with this signature box, can someone direct me to some documentation?||||reg||9
Z||000033||tgowens||07-11-2000||01:52 PM||||Bugsy, when you post a message, on the left of the screen you will see a link titled '*UBB Code is ON' - click that and it will instruct you on how to use the UBB code required to make a signature. Then go to the link on the top right of the forum page titled 'Pennock's Fiero Forum profile | register || faq | search ' - click on 'profile' and in your profile you will see a "signature" text box......that is where you will enter your "signature" -- if you desire to use an image in your signature, it has to be uploaded to YOUR server and noted in the signature box.........try it and if you have any problems, email me at  <A HREF="mailto:terry@tgowens.com">terry@tgowens.com</A>  and I will help you straighten it out.......<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/my_fiero_sig.gif">   <BR>'87 Fiero GT -  <A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero/" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A>||208.200.110.155||reg||1
